    "question": "Adam's father deposited $2000 in the bank. It receives 8% interest paid throughout the year, and he withdraws the interest as soon as it is deposited.  How much will Adam\u2019s father have, including his deposit and the interest received after 2 and a half years?",
    "question_sha256": "0f86611879e4cc4594c55ec44fca40bc224d208044ced920cff999abdc25cb60",
