        "student_prefix_sha256": "8edb742217804cf67be962984f33b2c1ccdf10d01eec0c4995062580c5b68e27",
        "target": "Given:\n- Initial deposit: $2000\n- Annual interest rate: 8%\n- Withdrawal of interest as soon as it is deposited\n- Time period: 2.5 years\n\nEach year, the interest earned is 8% of $2000, which is:\n\\[ 2000 \\times 0.08 = 160 \\text{ dollars} \\]\n\nSince Adam's father withdraws the interest as soon as it is deposited, the principal remains $2000 each year. Over 2.5 years, he will receive interest for 2 full years and half of the third year.\n\nInterest for 2 full years:\n\\[ 160 \\times 2 = 320 \\text{ dollars} \\]\n\nInterest for half a year:\n\\[ 160 \\times 0.5 = 80 \\text{ dollars} \\]\n\nTotal interest received in 2.5 years:\n\\[ 320 + 80 = 400 \\text{ dollars} \\]\n\nAdding the total interest to the initial deposit:\n\\[ 2000 + 400 = 2400 \\text{ dollars} \\]\n\nFINAL: 2400",
